{"3094540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cavescape", "steam_appid": 3094540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAL THE DRAGON EGG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your 1–4 player crew got hired by a black-market dealer to steal a priceless dragon egg. In return, he’ll erase your gambling debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the egg deep inside an active volcano and get it back to the surface before the lava swallows it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous caves, use grappling hooks and gadgets to overcome obstacles, and work together to transport the egg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is dangerous, the egg is fragile, and none of you know what you’re doing.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAL THE DRAGON EGG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your 1–4 player crew got hired by a black-market dealer to steal a priceless dragon egg. In return, he’ll erase your gambling debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the egg deep inside an active volcano and get it back to the surface before the lava swallows it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous caves, use grappling hooks and gadgets to overcome obstacles, and work together to transport the egg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is dangerous, the egg is fragile, and none of you know what you’re doing.</p>", "short_description": "1–4 players pull off the egg heist of the century! To pay off your debt, a black-market dealer hires you to steal a dragon’s egg - work together to find the egg and transport it out of the volcano before it erupts!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094540/7b3239ccd2da65100a58bc27ac89f333c6bfdb5a/header.jpg?t=1787515057", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094540/039b5